  "title": "Honey Butter Zucchini Bread",
  "description": "This buttery, honey-sweetened zucchini bread recipe, made with self-rising flour, is full of warm spices and studded with walnuts and coconut flakes.",
  "authors": [
    "Bonnie Marie"
  ],
